(6666120, 995836, 142473, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo, lots of detail, appropriate color editing.  I think I might have gotten rid of a few of the red cups, but it does add a lot to the insanity of the image.</td>', 'Interesting photo, lots of detail, appropriate color editing.  I think I might have gotten rid of a few of the red cups, but it does add a lot to the insanity of the image.', '2012-02-07 10:38:24.000000', NULL, 1),
