(6666126, 995041, 142473, '<td valign="top">The close focus is interesting here, and really draws your eye back to the bench.  You just needed a model of some kind to bring the image home.</td>', 'The close focus is interesting here, and really draws your eye back to the bench.  You just needed a model of some kind to bring the image home.', '2012-02-07 10:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6666128, 996512, 142473, '<td valign="top">Nice seduction here.  Might have been good to hide her top foot, because I think that''s drawing too much focus.  Just the top knee might have been better?  I do like the look in her eyes and the general pose.  He looks interesting... like he''s really pondering something.  Nice image of high-class society.</td>', 'Nice seduction here.  Might have been good to hide her top foot, because I think that''s drawing too much focus.  Just the top knee might have been better?  I do like the look in her eyes and the general pose.  He looks interesting... like he''s really pondering something.  Nice image of high-class society.', '2012-02-07 10:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6666237, 995216, 142473, '<td valign="top">Nice macro.  Makes a nice interesting subject, but maybe it could have been a bit stronger.  I think the words on the black background take away from the corks and steal some attention.</td>', 'Nice macro.  Makes a nice interesting subject, but maybe it could have been a bit stronger.  I think the words on the black background take away from the corks and steal some attention.', '2012-02-07 13:02:57.000000', NULL, 1),
