(6666256, 995401, 142473, '<td valign="top">Pretty funny little picture!  From the thumbnail I originally thought this was a much ''darker'' image, because the sprinkles looked like pills!<br/> <br/>I like it big better.</td>', 'Pretty funny little picture!  From the thumbnail I originally thought this was a much ''darker'' image, because the sprinkles looked like pills! I like it big better.', '2012-02-07 14:00:50.000000', NULL, 1),
