(6666885, 996096, 142766, '<td valign="top">Thanks for your comments and notes !<br/>My first idea was actually to blew them out, but I did a first try... and there was almost no smoke ! :-(<br/>This is why I let them burn until they blew out, shooting a few photos meanwhile, and chose this one where most flames were still on. Shortly after, the light on the blew out candles was not interesting.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Thanks for your comments and notes !My first idea was actually to blew them out, but I did a first try... and there was almost no smoke ! :-(This is why I let them burn until they blew out, shooting a few photos meanwhile, and chose this one where most flames were still on. Shortly after, the light on the blew out candles was not interesting. ', '2012-02-08 01:27:19.000000', NULL, 0),
